    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that but it doesnt feel like that. i have people looking at me like they're waiting for the train wreck. my wife, my parents... they're all going to see me at the absolute bottom. once you hit that rock bottom, you're just a shell. there's no coming back from that kind of humiliation. it feels like the only thing left is just watching the crash happen and waiting for the impact.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
